                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you played and liked the other games in the Braveland series then you'll have a good time with this one as well. \n\nFor everyone else...\n- Music gets grating very quickly and if you mute it the SFX are not enough to carry the game.\n- There is no story worth mentioning. You are here strictly for the simplified hex grid turn based combat and that's it.\n- The combat itself does present some interesting choices, but the enemies on the last island are absolutely GRUELING, especially if you try playing on Hard.\n\nDid I have an OK enough time when I bought this cellphone game re-release for 99 cents? Yeah. Would I ever go out of my way to RECOMMEND it to anyone? Hell no.",
